      "updated": 1793442666530,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> You can always inspect the different kernels that\n   you're using within Jupyter Notebooks\n\n\n--> A kernel is one to one with a process\n\n\n\n\n\n\n--> You can look and inspect different aspects \n   of that kernel through some of the different \n   inspection tools",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> You can always inspect the different kernels that\n   you're using within Jupyter Notebooks\n\n\n--> A kernel is one to one with a process\n\n\n\n\n\n\n--> You can look and inspect different aspects \n   of that kernel through some of the different \n   inspection tools",
