      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- The Host CPU section displays :\n    ° the total amount of CPU available\n    ° the total memory available \n  on the OpenShift node. \n\n- It also displays :\n    ° the current amount of CPU the node is using\n    ° the current amount of memory the node is using",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- The Host CPU section displays :\n    ° the total amount of CPU available\n    ° the total memory available \n  on the OpenShift node. \n\n- It also displays :\n    ° the current amount of CPU the node is using\n    ° the current amount of memory the node is using",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
