      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793442666530,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> You can always look at the bottom of the Notebook\n    and see how much memory is currently being consumed\n\n--> Memory is especially critical as if you go over\n    the amount of memory allocated, it will cause\n    an OOM error or an out of memory error\n\n--> This will cause your process to fail and your \n    experimentation to fail, in which case, \n    you'll have to start over",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> You can always look at the bottom of the Notebook\n    and see how much memory is currently being consumed\n\n--> Memory is especially critical as if you go over\n    the amount of memory allocated, it will cause\n    an OOM error or an out of memory error\n\n--> This will cause your process to fail and your \n    experimentation to fail, in which case, \n    you'll have to start over",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793442662166,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
